# [MUST] CSS / Styles

- Follow `FRONTEND/SKILL.md` §0–§2 strictly.
- NEVER hardcode hex, `bg-red-600`, or `bg-[#hex]`. Use `var(--token)` only.
- All tokens defined in `resources/css/globals.css` (imported by `app.css`).

